{"title": "Undead Bane", "pageid": 28089, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Undead_Bane", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Undead Bane</b> is a passive feature that enhances combat against undead creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack rolls</a> with this weapon have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> against Undead.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pelorsun_Blade\" title=\"Pelorsun Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pelorsun_Blade\" title=\"Pelorsun Blade\">Pelorsun Blade</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite the description, Undead Bane provides Advantage to <i>all</i> attacks rolls made against Undead targets.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195935\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1021/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7934/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2088/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754613/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.944      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.944      1 -total\n 33.59%   12.745      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 25.76%    9.773      1 Template:Advantage\n 24.47%    9.285      1 Template:Icon_link\n 23.54%    8.932      1 Template:Icon_text\n 22.77%    8.641     